{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56138","headline":"解坛颂 · 杜光庭","name":"解坛颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太空包有象，至道杳无形。\n承和通妙气，应感达中情。\n倏忽周八极，依稀降万灵。\n微香陈素欵，委质表丹诚。\n远泛翔鸾盖，遐攀绮凤旌。\n烟宫高郁郁，云阁上亭亭。\n琼驾出霄汉，金龙入太清。\n甘露洽人世，家国悉安宁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56138.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56138","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}